{"id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md","title":"Signed Measure","display":"df-signed-measure — Signed Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-signed-measure","aliases":["58-df-signed-measure","Signed Measure","Signed Borel Measure","58-df-zfc-measure2-signed-measure","58-df-zfc-measure5-signed-measure","58-df-zfc-measure6-signed-measure"],"display":"df-signed-measure — Signed Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-signed-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-signed-measure</span><span>Signed Measure</span><span>Signed Borel Measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-signed-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-signed-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-signed-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-signed-measure — Signed Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SignedMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SignedMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SignedMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SignedMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signed\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[-\\infty,\\infty]\n\\land\\mu(\\emptyset)=0\n\\land\\neg\\left[\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(\\mu(A)=+\\infty\\land\\mu(B)=-\\infty)\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to A(m)\\cap A(n)=\\emptyset)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\mu\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A(n)\\right)\n=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(A(n))\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signed\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[-\\infty,\\infty]\n\\land\\mu(\\emptyset)=0\n\\land\\neg\\left[\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(\\mu(A)=+\\infty\\land\\mu(B)=-\\infty)\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to A(m)\\cap A(n)=\\emptyset)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\mu\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A(n)\\right)\n=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(A(n))\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signed\\text{-}measure\\text{-}aliases}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signed\\text{-}measure\\text{-}aliases}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and sigma-algebra are explicit, and all compatibility aliases have the same arity.</li>\n<li>Existence and uniqueness of the Jordan decomposition are theorems about this predicate, not clauses of the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Folland, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SignedMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SignedMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signed\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[-\\infty,\\infty]\n\\land\\mu(\\emptyset)=0\n\\land\\neg\\left[\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(\\mu(A)=+\\infty\\land\\mu(B)=-\\infty)\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to A(m)\\cap A(n)=\\emptyset)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\mu\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A(n)\\right)\n=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(A(n))\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signed\\text{-}measure\\text{-}aliases}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F).","display":true}],"bytes":1912,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf89ebe6b026d89d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (signed-measure predicate with carrier and sigma-algebra; see [[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]])"},{"id":"71806da6139ee022